-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제28211호, 2017.7.26&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div><div class="law-detail__addenda" id="supp-9"><div class="css-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제28358호,2017.10.17&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div><div class="law-detail__addenda" id="supp-10"><div class="css-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제28521호, 2017.12.29&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div><div class="law-detail__addenda" id="supp-11"><div class="css-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제28728호, 2018.3.30&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div><div class="law-detail__addenda" id="supp-12"><div class="css-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제29305호,2018.11.27&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div><div class="law-detail__addenda" id="supp-13"><div class="css-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제31380호,2021.1.5&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div><div class="law-detail__addenda" id="supp-14"><div class="css-jwr3dz"><div class="addenda__titles"><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--bold">부      칙</i><i class="addenda__title addenda__title--normal">&lt;제33575호, 2023.6.27&gt;</i></div><button class="addenda__more">더보기<div class="addenda__more-icon css-1jhljyr"><div class="bc-icon bc-icon--basic-drop"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 7"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 .086l4.95 4.95L10.9.085l.707.707L5.95 6.45.293.793 1 .086z"